            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Consider with dirvish does - it re-sets `filetype=dirvish` [here](https://github.com/justinmk/vim-dirvish/blob/4cbf39ce024c57f700c4d5502cc172ea91d69360/autoload/dirvish.vim#L532-L542\r\n). \r\n\r\ndir.lua does not do that, to avoid re-firing a full `FileType directory` which is now our plugin/user dispatch point before the builtin browser owns the buf\r\n\r\nat least i conceptualize `FileType directory` as a hand-off point so I don't want to re-fire it",
