            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "main thing i'm wondering is whether this risks a double event. since there is no `return` following this. \r\n\r\ni didn't look where EVENT_FILETYPE is normally raised, but maybe this condition here could set a flag which is checked at the end of this function... assuming that helps anything",
            "commit_id": "0a04f1e8364dbf969cea83772af68689091a523b",
